@page "/education"

<PageTitle>Education</PageTitle>

<section class="education-header">
	<p class="education-eyebrow">Learning and achievement</p>
	<h1>Education</h1>
	<p class="education-intro">A record of academic study, competitions, and the qualifications that have shaped my work.</p>
</section>

<section class="education-sections" aria-label="Education history">
	<details class="education-section" open>
		<summary>
			<span>Academic tests + competitions</span>
			<span class="summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
		</summary>
		<div class="education-section-content">
			<p>Academic challenges have provided opportunities to apply problem-solving, reasoning, and subject knowledge beyond the classroom.</p>
			<div class="qualification-table" role="table" aria-label="Academic tests and competitions">
				<div class="qualification-row qualification-heading" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Certification</span><span role="columnheader">Grade</span></div>
				<div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Academic test or competition</span><span role="cell">To be added</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</details>

	<details class="education-section">
		<summary>
			<span>University</span>
			<span class="summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
		</summary>
		<div class="education-section-content">
			<p>University study developed my ability to work independently, communicate technical ideas, and build a rigorous understanding of my subject.</p>
			<div class="qualification-table" role="table" aria-label="University qualifications">
				<div class="qualification-row qualification-heading" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Certification</span><span role="columnheader">Grade</span></div>
				<div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">University degree</span><span role="cell">To be added</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</details>

	<details class="education-section">
		<summary>
			<span>A Level</span>
			<span class="summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
		</summary>
		<div class="education-section-content">
			<p>A Level study strengthened my subject knowledge and prepared me for more independent academic work and problem-solving.</p>
			<div class="qualification-table" role="table" aria-label="A Level qualifications">
				<div class="qualification-row qualification-heading" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Certification</span><span role="columnheader">Grade</span></div>
				<div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">A Level subject</span><span role="cell">To be added</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</details>

	<details class="education-section">
		<summary>
			<span>GCSE</span>
			<span class="summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
		</summary>
		<div class="education-section-content">
			<p>GCSE study established the foundations for continued learning across a broad range of subjects.</p>
			<div class="qualification-table" role="table" aria-label="GCSE qualifications">
				<div class="qualification-row qualification-heading" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Certification</span><span role="columnheader">Grade</span></div>
				<div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">GCSE subject</span><span role="cell">To be added</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</details>
</section>